[{:db/id "q-122876/selection/93fb35923b6f2449a5dd793d3352b67607663a126d3af189245e2b8b32795e1b" :answer/id #uuid "ba59ca59-d1a7-5a0e-89ab-7fd784e8f038" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{m}_{11}+{m}_{12}+{m}_{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876/selection/363023cce800a8953753f83e0f3c12533a3dc813019c342f7952f8f781105bc8" :answer/id #uuid "dcd07bf3-bb8c-534f-a5fe-e8290031d9ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2({m}_{11}+{m}_{12}+{m}_{13})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876/selection/d9eb3723519e013fec35668a44842e25beb5e3394ac062727ca8150bb5df385b" :answer/id #uuid "10754718-8327-598b-ae0a-fc17db8b4edd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cdot {m}_{11}\\cdot {m}_{12}\\cdot {m}_{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876/selection/0fb6c465303ebc2144f49e09345c4ab45d2343553c2b57342977b778c78adf56" :answer/id #uuid "29cc7d83-a830-5a1c-8e3c-218d8330e430" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{m}_{11}+{m}_{12}+{m}_{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876/selection/64f57f5d77bbcb8f1995637406db69a8f26ea9d06767fe852b85901d20fe93eb" :answer/id #uuid "fba0251e-6617-5bd9-b2c8-733531c56745" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3({m}_{11}+{m}_{12}+{m}_{13})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e396a8d4-801c-5f9b-9738-7747e0d05163" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-122876/selection/64f57f5d77bbcb8f1995637406db69a8f26ea9d06767fe852b85901d20fe93eb" :answer-field/choices ["q-122876/selection/93fb35923b6f2449a5dd793d3352b67607663a126d3af189245e2b8b32795e1b" "q-122876/selection/363023cce800a8953753f83e0f3c12533a3dc813019c342f7952f8f781105bc8" "q-122876/selection/d9eb3723519e013fec35668a44842e25beb5e3394ac062727ca8150bb5df385b" "q-122876/selection/0fb6c465303ebc2144f49e09345c4ab45d2343553c2b57342977b778c78adf56" "q-122876/selection/64f57f5d77bbcb8f1995637406db69a8f26ea9d06767fe852b85901d20fe93eb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-122876" :question/id #uuid "0fc86049-64cc-5cd7-9cd9-a6d9803210f4" :question/math-academy-id "q-122876" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072149/assets/0abae6be42361d157d7cbd46f602d3a0d2044cfec551c61a2739ff9b56798cc3.png)\n\nConsider the partition of the rectangular region $R$ shown above and the positive function $f(x,y)$ defined on $R.$ Which of the following gives an expression for the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to this partition.\n\n*Hint: ${m}_{ij}$ denotes the minimum value of $f$ on the subregion ${R}_{ij}$*" :question/worked-solution "To calculate the lower Riemann sum $L$ with respect to the given partition, we compute the sum of the volumes of $3$ rectangular solids, one for each ${R}_{ij}.$\n\nThe volume of the rectangular solid corresponding to each subregion ${R}_{ij}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{m}_{ij}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{ij}).\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ denotes the minimum value of $f$ on the subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ We pick the *minimum* value of $f$ because we're finding the *lower* sum.\n\nSo in our case, we have\n\n$$\nL={m}_{11}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{11})+{m}_{12}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{12})+{m}_{13}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{13}).\n$$\n\nNotice that\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}({R}_{11})=\\text{Area}({R}_{12})=\\text{Area}({R}_{13})=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & =3\\cdot {m}_{11}+3\\cdot {m}_{12}+3\\cdot {m}_{13} \\\\  & =3({m}_{11}+{m}_{12}+{m}_{13}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-122876/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c6123a27-2dc8-5076-8c77-1bf056f46566"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-122876"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-122887/selection/fc95f4eefb70f7e6c21373475f756ff15cc3e922c5abc2d9d6d022097fd31c46" :answer/id #uuid "373416